OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights from airports in the UK and
OL,8,FIreland are being heavily disrupted by
OL,9,Fa technical problem affecting the air
OL,10,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,12,FAt least 425 flights in or out of the
OL,13,FUK have been cancelled, according to
OL,14,Ftracking website FlightRadar24. EasyJet
OL,15,Fand British Airways have cancelled more
OL,16,Fthan 100 each.
OL,18,FNats said just before 17:00 BST that
OL,19,Fits flight systems were starting to
OL,20,Frecover.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
